  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.4,
      "text": "take a simple three-word phrase, dog bites man. If the computer receives those three tokens all"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.4,
      "end": 11.22,
      "text": "at once without knowing the sequence, they could easily be arranged as man bites dog."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.78,
      "end": 17.24,
      "text": "The raw tokens are identical, but without sequence, the meaning is destroyed. To solve this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.4,
      "end": 22.06,
      "text": "the architecture includes an extra step. It stamps the vector with a signal saying,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.48,
      "end": 28.1,
      "text": "I am token number one, or I am token number two. The technical name for this critical structural"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.1,
      "end": 34.12,
      "text": "patch is positional encoding. The AI gets the full computational benefit of simultaneous processing"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.12,
      "end": 37.02,
      "text": "while preserving the linear narrative of human speech."
    }
  ],
